{
	"registryNote": "lib/openapi-forge keyword registry (nextStandards-102326 K0). DATA: which OpenAPI 3 / JSON Schema keyword the kit carries at which position, and how. A keyword absent from its position's table is REFUSED BY NAME by the walk; adding one is a row here plus a twin, never a code branch. Positions: 'schema' (a components.schemas member), 'property' (a member of a schema's properties), 'items' (a property's items), 'branch' (one member of a oneOf/anyOf/allOf at property or items position). A branch admits no items and no composition, so nested composition refuses by the same rule. Carriages: nodeProperty (a scalar under propertyName, of valueKind, optionally only requiredValue), requiredList, propertyMap, items, reference, enum, composition.",
	"vendorExtensionRule": {
		"namePrefix": "x-",
		"positionList": ["schema", "property"],
		"propertyNamePrefix": "x",
		"valueKind": "string"
	},
	"compositionConstructList": ["oneOf", "anyOf", "allOf"],
	"carriageByPosition": {
		"schema": {
